        "type": "the-purpose",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "This topic set focuses on the user's goal of designing a self-development system with metacognition as its core component. The topics move beyond a simple definition of \"thinking about thinking\" and frame metacognition as an active, practical tool. They explore how to architect a system that *embeds* reflective practice, how to use metacognition as a diagnostic tool to decide *what* to change, and how to use it as a regulatory engine to decide *how* to change. Furthermore, the topics cover the critical functions of measurement and iterative refinement, directly addressing the user's need to measure change and determine *when* to adapt their plan.",
        "line_number": 31,
        "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md",
        "char_start": 567,
