      "unordered": [
        {
          "text": "**Double-Loop Learning (Chris Argyris):** This directly relates to your goal. Single-loop learning is changing *actions* to hit a target. Double-loop learning is using metacognition to change the *underlying assumptions and mental models* (the \"why\") that define the target in the first place.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 106,
          "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Self-Determination Theory (Deci & Ryan):** A useful framework for deciding \"what\" to change, focusing on the core psychological needs of Autonomy, Competence, and Relatedness.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 111,
          "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Cognitive Reappraisal:** A specific metacognitive *strategy* for emotional regulation, falling under the \"how to change\" category.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 122,
          "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Implementation Intentions (Peter Gollwitzer):** A practical, evidence-based method for \"how to change\" by creating specific \"If-Then\" plans that bridge the gap between intention and action.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 122,
          "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Reflective Practice Models (Schön, Gibbs):** Examining established models of reflection can provide a solid structure for the \"how\" of building your metacognitive routines.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 122,
          "source": "topic-set_metacognition-as-the-engine-for-personal-development-systems_🆔20251105010056.md"
        }
      ]
    },
